# Web catalog scope

Read `web/.cursor/plans/web-catalog.md` before `web-catalog` work. Follow the slice order. Do not start a later slice until the previous slice's progress note exists.

This stage is management for `MASTER_ADMIN` and `SYSTEM_ADMIN`: courses, content, books, payment verification, offline admission, and book-order fulfillment. Students do not browse, purchase, or open lectures here.

Hide controls the role cannot call. Do not render them disabled. System Admin does not see price, delete, archive, close, reopen, payment verification, or cash collected.

When a slice's checks finish, write `web/.cursor/progress/web-catalog/slice-<number>-<name>.md` before the next slice.

**Agent:** `npm run lint`, `npm run build`, `npm run check:openapi`, and mocked component tests when present. Do not boot `api` for component tests. **Shahriar:** browser exit after slice 7 only. The agent must not open a browser or use browser automation.

A wrong API field is an `api` defect. Fix `api` and its tests before adapting the client. The list `GET /api/v1/book-orders` is the only new API in this stage.
